          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "check"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". A king in check must get out of check on the very next move, and there are three ways: move the king, block the check with another piece, or capture the piece giving it. Here the rook on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e1"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " gives check to the black king on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
